      "hook": "Juliana hikes up her wedding dress in the rain and declares defiantly, 'At least no one there will be waiting to humiliate me.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana admits she is disappointed, then says warmly, 'But not because of you,' leaving the reason for her disappointment unresolved.",
      "why": "It opens on a defiant, emotionally charged line and ends on a tender but unresolved confession that makes viewers want to know what she lost.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger would not know why Juliana was humiliated or what she lost, which is exactly the mystery that drives install."
    },
    {
      "title": "A Bride's Hidden Grief",
      "start_block": "B057",
      "end_block": "B083",
      "hook": "Juliana grabs a rag and scrubs the table, her voice trembling as she says, 'If I stop now, I will think about everything I lost.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana kneels before the fire and says softly, 'It is enough for tonight,' leaving her grief and their future unresolved.",
      "why": "It starts with raw, suppressed emotion and ends on a fragile moment of comfort that could break at any second.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger would not know the specifics of Juliana's loss, but the emotional weight is universal enough to hook them."
    },
    {
      "title": "Safe Beside the Fire",
      "start_block": "B086",
      "end_block": "B096",
      "hook": "Juliana's voice-over confesses, 'I lost my home today. My family. Everything I thought my life would be.'",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana looks up with quiet hope as the flames fade to black, leaving her new life with the scarred stranger completely unresolved.",
      "why": "It uses the episode's final emotional beat as a cliffhanger, ending on hope and uncertainty that demands the next episode.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger would not know who the scarred man is or why she feels safe with him, which is the central mystery of the series."
    }
  ],
